{"id":"n15890-1-8","stage":3,"title":"밤새우다 · 熬夜","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15890-1-8-1","ko":"오늘 발표 잘했어?","zh":"今天演讲做得不错吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발표","meaning":"发表，发布","explanation":"발표：发表，发布","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘했어?","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"662fbb8d7bdeae80","term":"발표","zh":"发表，发布","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3","entryId":"62470","definition":"向世人公开并传播某种事实、结果或作品等。","pronunciation":["발표"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/914e975b45b37a45b070.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15890-1-8-2","ko":"응, 몇 날 며칠을 밤새운 보람이 있었던 것 같아.","zh":"嗯，感觉这几天的熬夜总算有了回报。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几","explanation":"몇：几","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"1","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날","meaning":"天，日","explanation":"날：天，日","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"1","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"며칠을","meaning":"几天","explanation":"며칠：几天；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36676","senseId":"2","lemma":"며칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밤새운","meaning":"熬夜","explanation":"밤새우다：熬夜；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"밤새우다","audio":"/audio/b79afc60d23ff1950a25.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15890","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤새우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보람이","meaning":"意义","explanation":"보람：意义；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"보람","audio":"/audio/39b3039cb7767155328b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58725","senseId":"1","lemma":"보람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었던","meaning":"过","explanation":"있다：过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几","aud